#------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   Name            : s_pordmmn001.scr
#   Description     : This script is used for population of credit details
#   Date            : 28-05-2013
#   Author          : Bharath
#   Input           : NA
#   Output          : NA
#   Called Script   : NA
#   Calling Script  : SRV_CalculatePaymentDatesAndPaysysId_post_process_data.scr
#   Menu Option     : HPORDM
#   Srl. No         Date            	Author          	Description.
